@startuml
title ATM Withdrawal Process

[*] --> Idle
Idle --> WaitingForInput : Card Inserted
WaitingForInput --> EnteringAmount : Choose Withdrawal Amount
EnteringAmount --> ConfirmingAmount : Amount Entered
ConfirmingAmount --> ProcessingTransaction : Confirm Amount
ConfirmingAmount --> WaitingForInput : Cancel Transaction
ProcessingTransaction --> DispensingCash : Transaction Approved
ProcessingTransaction --> ReturningCard : Transaction Declined
ProcessingTransaction --> Cancelled : System Error
DispensingCash --> ReturningCard : Cash Dispensed
ReturningCard --> Idle : Card Returned
Cancelled --> Idle : Transaction Cancelled
Idle --> [*] : Completion Event
@enduml
